			<tr><th id="akame_g">アカメアマガエル（グリーン）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaflo2_003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaflo2_004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_004.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaflo2_013.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaflo2_021.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：寺岡邦明<br />
				今回の目玉。カラフルな体色でラインナップが一気に華やかになりますね。<br />
				丸まっても隠し切れない大きな吸盤が特徴的。<br />
				ツヤ有りの塗装がいい感じ。<br />
				裏側の塗装はグラデーション＋斑点で素晴らしい。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaflo2_001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaflo2_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">記憶に新しいのはNTCMONO+のもの。そちらはイボイボ造形＋つや消し塗装でした。<br />
				もちろん両者で立体化のコンセプトは違うため、シリーズの違う２つを比べる際は注意しよう。</td></tr>
			<tr><th id="akame_a">アカメアマガエル（アルビノ）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaflo2_006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_006.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaflo2_007.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_007.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaflo2_022.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaflo2_022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru2/img/osaflo2_022.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：寺岡邦明<br />
				アルビノ版はご覧のとおりの黄色。体側の模様や目の周りの色も違います。</td></tr>
